menu "e32p: uds"

    config E32P_UDS_ENABLE
        bool "Enable e32p_uds (ISO 14229-1 UDS server)"
        depends on SOC_TWAI_SUPPORTED
        select E32P_ISOTP_ENABLE
        default n
        help
            A UDS server over ISO-TP: diagnostic sessions with the S3 timeout,
            security access with a lockout, data identifiers, trouble codes,
            routines, and a download path that can reflash the device.

            The server is pure - requests in, responses out through a callback,
            time injected through poll() - so every timing rule, including the
            0x78 responsePending cadence, is testable headless. Only the thin
            transport glue touches ISO-TP.

endmenu
